{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_07",
  "title": "制动失灵",
  "storyCode": "RS-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a13de931337e9af7a8bdcf947497fdafec0107d41bf72589db5426b7ce9bca90",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "侍女长，周围的人都已经疏散了，你怎么还留在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "休露丝夫人才是，您不是应该已经回避了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "哼，你说回避我就要回避吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "这座雕像可是所有人的心血，要是出了岔子，我要怎么和其他人交代？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "是所有人的心血，还是恩希欧迪斯的心血？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "......难怪刚才我就看到圣女大人把你按了回去，看来圣女大人对你说过一些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "夫人并不惊讶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "我又不是傻子，圣女大人看起来毫不知情，但她怎么可能真的毫不知情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "只是，以她的立场来说，知道，但又不知道，才是她最应该做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "而她现在派你来捅破这层窗户纸，说吧，什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "正在靠近这里的人，一个是锏，一个是维多利亚的“灰礼帽”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”？！\n啧，他难道......不，应该不至于......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "text": "圣女大人是特意留你在这里给我提醒的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "您就当作是这么一回事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "雕像这边交给我就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "到此为止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "咳......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......不愧是黑骑士，个人实力不容小觑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "不过如果只是这样，您应该清楚，您是对付不了我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我不讨厌有自信的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "不过，我的耐心有限。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你来回逃窜的样子，已经开始让我觉得有点无聊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我很抱歉，女士。让您感到无聊是我的失职。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "只不过，恕我直言，锏女士，您的招式中没有杀意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾经在卡西米尔所向披靡，以一把巨剑令对手闻风丧胆的黑骑士，如今却用着这样没有锋刃的武器——\n嘶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "这种没有锋刃的武器对付你足够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "用莱塔尼亚的巨剑比赛，是那些商人的诉求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "呵，“用巨剑的莱塔尼亚武者”“用不了源石技艺的怪胎”......随便怎么说都行，无所谓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "但好像时间久了，你们都忘了一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "最开始我选择锏做武器的理由——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "什么......呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人的话被袭面而来的风雪堵回口中。\n袭向他的是谢拉格刺骨的寒风，是压面而至的无情山雪，是冰冷而重万钧的长锏。\n不容任何反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "——？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "咳哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "这只是一个警告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "来找恩希欧迪斯麻烦的人很多，如果每一个都能碾死了事，我的麻烦也会少很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "可惜，有些人活着比死去更有用处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "就比如你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "咳、咳咳......原来如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "看来还要多谢，锏女士手下留情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "锏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我用它的理由很简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "它没有刃，用它，留你们这样的人一条命会变得轻松一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "就算是这种没有利刃的武器，只要再多用一点力气，大部分人就会变成一摊肉泥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "从以前开始，一直如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "有一些人称得上对手，大多数人却会被轻易碾碎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "不管是莱塔尼亚的术师，还是卡西米尔的骑士，都没什么不同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "信念也好，理想也好，再高涨的情绪，再坚定的意志，在力量面前都不堪一击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "可笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "太简单就坏掉也是一种困扰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以锏为名的女人居高临下地俯视面前的维多利亚人，这并不是一个好对付的敌手，因此才会由她，也只能由她来出面应对。\n可即便如此，要击败对方也并不困难。\n以一介无法使用源石技艺的贫民为起点，到成为骑士竞赛蝉联三届冠军的黑骑士，这一路走来并不简单。\n可这之后的一切却又都太简单了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "哈......与“天生的武者”黑骑士相比，大部分人确实都可以用“脆弱”来形容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "别误会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "如果你再认真一点，我也得费点心思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我很遗憾，作为情报人员，我应该认真的地方，从来不是战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "哇哦，他们已经打到脚手架上去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "这个“灰礼帽”还真有点本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "在锏的手下从雪山一路逃窜到湖心岛，放眼整个谢拉格，应该没人能做得到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "而这样的人竟然在维多利亚还有许多？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "哎呀，这片大地真可怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "是啊，这片大地真可怕，每天都要应付这些麻烦事，我好想找个人代替我当圣女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "别想啦，圣女有今天的地位不也是你自找的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "你和你哥哥在这方面倒是挺像的，总是喜欢给自己找事做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "不许说我和他一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "好吧好吧，那就他和你一样，行了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "雅儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "你还记得我们的约定吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "嗯？哪一个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "别装傻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "好啦，我当然记得，“耶拉冈德只需要看着祂的子民就足够了”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "当时的我已经有些作弊了......要是连这件事也要依赖祂，那我也好，他也好，我们的理想都只是一句空话罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "......当旁观者要比你想的辛苦一些哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "那就只能请祂忍耐一下啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "好吧，虽然不知道祂能不能听到我们的约定就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "反正，我只是来看一看还能不能给这座雕像动动手脚而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "你果然没放弃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "只有这一点，我是绝对不会放弃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "哇，锏刚才那一脚，我总觉得整座雕像好像歪了一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "唔，“灰礼帽”也不差，居然抓住雕像的手指调整身体的平衡，真不是盖的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "他们能不能帮我瘦个脸啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "唉，最早的时候不懂事，觉得外表怎样都好，也就不太在乎自己的仪表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "后来交流得多了，审美也就跟着人变了，才逐渐有了今天的样貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "但是，那些典籍里的画像一直存在，早知道从埃德怀斯家出去的时候，应该拿走那些有我画像的典籍的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "谁知道这会儿他们忽然要给耶拉冈德建雕像啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "哇，一眨眼的工夫，这两个人就已经爬上雕像的顶部了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "哎，对，那边的脸颊可以再削一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "啊呀，别把鬓角也削掉呀，那个我还挺喜欢的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "嗯......从这个角度看，好像还可以接受？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "而且，认识恩雅以后，反倒跟着她开始注意起自己的仪表了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "每次陪着她偷偷出去逛街，她都会推荐一堆可爱的小玩意，不知道什么时候开始，我自己也喜欢上这些东西了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "对哦，刚才鬓角削掉的地方或许可以改成饰品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "这个可以记一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "哇，“灰礼帽”好惨，想要从头顶跳下来，但是被锏一脚给踢飞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "真可怜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "我在想，锏以前的对手，是不是就和“灰礼帽”现在的心情一样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "明知道自己不是对手，但没有办法，总要挣扎一下，说不定有机会呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "直到最后发现自己果然还是没有机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "那些为了财富而站上战场的人，要比他更软弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "满意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我看你看着我们给雕像修容好像挺开心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "结果满意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "嗯，还不坏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "你要去哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "他那样死不了，早晚会回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我还得去看着他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "你确定你不会被他甩掉吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "虽然正面过招他不是你的对手，但是他成心想要甩掉你恐怕也不是难事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "而且，也不能保证他不是诱饵，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......这些事，我会交给恩希欧迪斯判断。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯现在顾不上这边，这点你应该比我还清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "交给我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "确切地说，交给圣女大人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雅儿晃了晃手中的通讯终端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "你都听到了吗，圣女大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "交给我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "锏小姐辛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "今晚的篝火晚会，你会来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "免了，我不太喜欢热闹的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你打算怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "要看住一个外国使节，一些外交手段比武力要更有效些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "他可不算外国使节。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "text": "他可以是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "也好，那就麻烦圣女了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "text": "这边可不是离开的方向哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的谢拉格人",
      "text": "唔，该不会死了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热心的谢拉格人",
      "text": "别围着看了，先想办法把人捞上来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活泼的谢拉格人",
      "text": "看装束，好像是外国人，这天气的水温，就是咱们本地人也不太扛得住啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "请问，发生什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的谢拉格人",
      "text": "刚才从湖心岛的方向忽然飞过来一个人，把冰面砸出了一个洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "什么？！嘶——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "让一让，请让一让。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈洛德挤过人群，定睛一看，顿时哑然失笑。\n结冰的湖面被砸出一个美丽的圆形，而圆形的中央，漂浮着一具“死尸”。\n而他正是为了接应这具“死尸”来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这个水温，嘶——我这把身子骨可折腾不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "请问哪位有带棍子一类的东西吗？这是我的朋友，我来把他捞上来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热心的谢拉格人",
      "text": "啧，还真没有能用的工具，要不去问附近冰钓的乡亲借根钓竿来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不用了，我有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "噢，太好——\n咦，罗莎琳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗨，大叔，又见面了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我的武器借你，先救人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好嘞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的谢拉格人",
      "text": "我们也来帮忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "借着罗莎琳的武器，在周围人的齐心协力之下，大家总算是把“死尸”给捞了上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "唔，看起来还没死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "虽然我不太愿意承认，不过他要是死了，那么事情可能就麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "唉，下手的人也理解这一点，所以才留手了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "先把他搬到温暖的地方去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "老板，借用一下烤炉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "text": "好嘞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这不是约翰吗，他应该在山上啊，怎么会摔到这里来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "山上？你遇到过他了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我在山上遇到他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不，没什么，只是说起来有点麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "大叔你呢，你这两天干啥呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哈哈，我原本就是代表维多利亚来祝贺耶拉冈德像落成的，而仪式就在明天，结束后我就该打道回府了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "所以我就趁着最后的机会，到处走了走，给妻女买了点纪念品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "大叔你还真闲啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "年轻的时候总是想做更多的事，到了我这个岁数才知道，还是清闲一点好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "咳咳咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哦，“尸体”活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "呕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "“约翰”，你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "罗莎琳小姐，还有子爵阁下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "太好了，我刚才都见到我死去的外祖父了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "你怎么成这样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这就，说来话长了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "您和您的父亲，相处得还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呃，就那样吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "父亲？发生了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”&烈夏",
      "text": "这就说来话长了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "怎么回事，“约翰”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "在我不知道的情况下，你居然变得比我和罗莎琳还要好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "终于找到你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "咦，圣女大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "圣女？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "初雪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "咦，烈夏，你也在啊，那正好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "正好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "子爵阁下应当记得，今晚会在银心湖边举办一场篝火晚会，作为明天落成仪式的预热。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "我听说您最近四处游山玩水，怕您忘了，所以特意来提醒一二。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我当然记得，请放心，我一定到场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "烈夏也一起来吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "篝火晚会？好啊，好啊，我一定到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "这位“灰礼帽”先生，我可以认为是您的朋友吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......是的，当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "既然是子爵阁下的朋友，那就是我谢拉格的客人，希望您也能赏脸参加这场晚会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......既然是圣女大人的邀请，岂有不从的道理？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "text": "那就......这么定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
